| 🔴 High | No authentication on `/users` (data exposure) | A01 - Broken Access Control |
| 🟠 Medium | No security headers (`helmet`) | A05 - Security Misconfiguration |
| 🟠 Medium | No rate limiting (DoS risk) | A05 - Security Misconfiguration |
| 🟡 Low | No error handling (info leakage) | A05 - Security Misconfiguration |
| 🟡 Low | Hardcoded port / no env config | A05 - Security Misconfiguration |
| 🟡 Low | No dependency lockfile | A06 - Vulnerable Components |

